68
00:05:44,130 --> 00:05:44,630
Cepatlah.

69
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:45,510
Apa yang terjadi, Nyonya Pemilik?

70
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:45,930
Cepat.

71
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,750
Kenapa orangnya banyak sekali?

72
00:05:48,140 --> 00:05:49,670
Aku akan pergi melihatnya.

73
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,880
Si Marga Xue, keluarlah!

74
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,680
Keluar.

75
00:05:59,170 --> 00:05:59,970
Cepat keluar.

76
00:06:02,080 --> 00:06:03,340
Di sini juga tidak ada.

77
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,260
