249
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,570
Orang itu Suanni, 'kan?

250
00:15:25,400 --> 00:15:27,000
Adikmu harus diselamatkan.

251
00:15:28,410 --> 00:15:29,360
Suanni

252
00:15:30,820 --> 00:15:32,200
juga harus ditemui.

253
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:36,940
Saat kalian menempelkannya,

254
00:15:36,940 --> 00:15:38,090
jangan hanya fokus pada jalan utama,

255
00:15:38,090 --> 00:15:40,470
harus perhatikan
jalan kecil dan gang juga.

256
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:40,920
Oh ya,

257
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:43,060
jika menemukan orang yang mencurigakan,
jangan ragu untuk bertindak.

258
00:15:43,060 --> 00:15:43,970
Tangkap saja dulu.

259
00:15:43,970 --> 00:15:44,640
Baik.

260
00:15:46,890 --> 00:15:47,540
Fang Du.

261
00:15:49,370 --> 00:15:50,060
Fang Du.

262
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:53,850
Tingyi.

263
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:55,390
Kenapa kamu masih berani datang kemari?

264
00:15:55,390 --> 00:15:56,210
Ada apa?

265
00:15:57,090 --> 00:15:58,260
Batalion Yong'an ini

266
00:15:58,260 --> 00:15:59,850
menutup dermaga dan mengunci gerbang kota,

267
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:01,800
bahkan mendirikan pos pemeriksaan
di mana-mana.

268
00:16:01,800 --> 00:16:02,800
Para prajurit ini

269
00:16:02,940 --> 00:16:04,800
